WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:09.262
&gt;&gt; AFTER DECADES OF FLAT-OUT

00:00:09.263 --> 00:00:10.297
LYING, THE DEFENSE

00:00:10.298 --> 00:00:11.431
ESTABLISHMENT IS FINDING

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:12.833
ADMITTING SOME OF WHAT IT

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.401
KNOWS ABOUT U.F.O.s.

00:00:14.402 --> 00:00:16.536
THE NAVY ADMITTED THAT THE

00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:22.142
PILOTS IDENTIFIED UNIDENTIFIED

00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:23.310
AIRCRAFT -- PILOTS COME IN

00:00:23.311 --> 00:00:28.381
CONTACT WITH UNIDENTIFIED

00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:29.282
AIRCRAFT OFTEN.

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:30.817
THEY ARE SEEING THINGS IN THE

00:00:30.818 --> 00:00:32.419
SKY THEY CAN'T ACCOUNT FOR,

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.687
AND DOING THINGS THEY CANNOT

00:00:33.688 --> 00:00:34.154
UNDERSTAND.

00:00:34.155 --> 00:00:37.190
SHOULD WE BE WORRIED?

00:00:37.191 --> 00:00:38.358
CONGRESSMAN MARK WALKER IS A

00:00:38.359 --> 00:00:39.059
REPUBLICAN REPRESENTING NORTH

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:39.426
CAROLINA.

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:41.495
HE JUST SENT A NAVY TO THE

00:00:41.496 --> 00:00:43.630
SECRETARY OF THE NAVY WILL

00:00:43.631 --> 00:00:44.765
SPENCER ABOUT THE U.F.O.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:45.198
INVESTIGATION.

00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:46.299
WE SPOKE TO THE CONGRESSMAN.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.136
HERE IS PART OF WHAT HE SAID.

00:00:49.137 --> 00:00:50.837
SHOULD WE BE WORRIED ABOUT

00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:51.605
THIS?

00:00:51.606 --> 00:00:53.039
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE ARE ARE CONCERNED

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:53.740
ABOUT IT.

00:00:53.741 --> 00:00:56.209
AS THE RANKING MEMBER OF

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:57.244
TERRORISM AND

00:00:57.245 --> 00:00:58.044
COUNTERINTELLIGENCE, WE HAVE

00:00:58.045 --> 00:00:58.411
QUESTIONS.

00:00:58.412 --> 00:01:02.149
IT COMES DOWN TO SOME OF THE

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:03.550
NEW INFRARED RADAR SYSTEMS ON

00:01:03.551 --> 00:01:05.018
THE NEW JETS.

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:06.453
THEY ARE DETECTING THINGS.

00:01:06.454 --> 00:01:07.954
WE CALL THEM UNIDENTIFIED

00:01:07.955 --> 00:01:08.421
AERIAL THREATS.

00:01:08.422 --> 00:01:14.094
THAT IS SOMETHING WE LOOK AT.

00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:15.929
U.A.T. IS WHAT WE CALL THEM.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.297
WE ARE TAKING A LOOK AT THIS.

00:01:17.298 --> 00:01:18.431
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THIS IS GOING ON

00:01:18.432 --> 00:01:18.932
FOR A LONG TIME.

00:01:18.933 --> 00:01:21.134
THERE IS A LOT OF DATA THE

00:01:21.135 --> 00:01:21.835
GOVERNMENT STORED ABOUT THIS.

00:01:21.836 --> 00:01:23.737
MOST OF IT IS STILL CLASSIFIED

00:01:23.738 --> 00:01:24.037
THERE.

00:01:24.038 --> 00:01:26.406
MUST BE THEORIES WHAT THE

00:01:26.407 --> 00:01:28.008
OBJECTS ARE AND WHAT THE

00:01:28.009 --> 00:01:28.575
AIRCRAFTS ARE.

00:01:28.576 --> 00:01:31.311
WHAT IS THE MOST PLAUSIBLE

00:01:31.312 --> 00:01:32.412
THEORY, DO YOU THINK?

00:01:32.413 --> 00:01:34.414
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW FOR SURE,

00:01:34.415 --> 00:01:34.948
OBVIOUSLY.

00:01:34.949 --> 00:01:36.149
WHAT WE DO KNOW AND THE

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.119
QUESTION WE WANT TO GO TO IS

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:39.953
THIS SOMETHING THAT IS A

00:01:39.954 --> 00:01:41.755
DEFENSE MECHANISM FROM ANOTHER

00:01:41.756 --> 00:01:42.122
COUNTRY?

00:01:42.123 --> 00:01:43.723
CHINA LOOKING AT THE HYPER

00:01:43.724 --> 00:01:44.424
SONIC MISSILES.

00:01:44.425 --> 00:01:46.593
TO BREAK IT DOWN TO OUR

00:01:46.594 --> 00:01:48.461
LANGUAGE IT WILL GET FROM D.C.

00:01:48.462 --> 00:01:51.364
TO L.A. IN NINE MINUTES.

00:01:51.365 --> 00:01:52.866
WE DON'T KNOW THAT NUCLEAR

00:01:52.867 --> 00:01:54.167
WARHEADS CAN BE ATTACHED TO

00:01:54.168 --> 00:01:54.534
THOSE.

00:01:54.535 --> 00:01:55.569
IS IT SOMETHING LIKE THAT?

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.537
OR IS IT SOMETHING MORE?

00:01:57.538 --> 00:01:58.071
WE DON'T KNOW.

00:01:58.072 --> 00:01:59.005
BUT I FEEL LIKE THIS IS

00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:00.607
SOMETHING TO TAKE A LOOK AT

00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:00.974
THAT.

00:02:00.975 --> 00:02:02.275
THAT IS WHY WE HAVE WRITTEN

00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:03.944
SECRETARY SPENCER OF THE NAVY.

00:02:03.945 --> 00:02:04.811
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS THERE ANY

00:02:04.812 --> 00:02:07.314
INDICATION THAT YOU ARE AWARE

00:02:07.315 --> 00:02:09.816
OF THAT THESE SIGHTINGS ARE

00:02:09.817 --> 00:02:11.384
FOREIGN AIRCRAFT, RUSSIAN OR

00:02:11.385 --> 00:02:12.819
CHINESE AIRCRAFT?

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.754
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW.

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:16.489
WE HAVE NO EVIDENCE TO SUPPORT

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.057
THAT.

00:02:17.058 --> 00:02:18.124
WE DO KNOW SOMETHING IS

00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:19.392
TRAVELING AT THAT SPEED OF

00:02:19.393 --> 00:02:22.462
WHAT WE CALL HYPERSONIC NOW.

00:02:22.463 --> 00:02:23.530
MACH 4 OR 5.

00:02:23.531 --> 00:02:25.232
NOT TO GET TOO TECHNICAL.

00:02:25.233 --> 00:02:26.633
THAT IS SOMETHING WE WANT TO

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:27.000
KNOW.

00:02:27.001 --> 00:02:28.301
IS THIS SOMETHING THAT ANOTHER

00:02:28.302 --> 00:02:29.135
DEFENSE SYSTEM IN ANOTHER

00:02:29.136 --> 00:02:30.303
COUNTRY IS MORE ADVANCED?

00:02:30.304 --> 00:02:31.338
OR IS IT SOMETHING ELSE?

00:02:31.339 --> 00:02:32.672
WE ARE NOT TRYING TO SPOOK

00:02:32.673 --> 00:02:33.440
PEOPLE OUT.

00:02:33.441 --> 00:02:35.709
BUT THE A.A.T.I.P., WHICH

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.977
BASICALLY IS A PROGRAM THAT

00:02:36.978 --> 00:02:38.178
THE GOVERNMENT MONITORS THIS

00:02:38.179 --> 00:02:40.280
WAS TO CLOSE DOWN IN 2017.

00:02:40.281 --> 00:02:42.015
SO PART OF MY QUESTION,

00:02:42.016 --> 00:02:43.617
TUCKER, IS IT REALLY CLOSED

00:02:43.618 --> 00:02:44.184
DOWN?

00:02:44.185 --> 00:02:46.219
ARE WE STILL SPENDING

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:46.653
RESOURCES?

00:02:46.654 --> 00:02:48.388
OR IS THERE MORE DOCUMENTATION

00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:49.589
THAT THIS PROGRAM IS STILL

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:50.557
BEING ABLE TO FILE SOMEWHERE?

00:02:50.558 --> 00:02:51.825
THAT IS SOMETHING WE NEED TO

00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:52.192
KNOW.

00:02:52.193 --> 00:02:53.493
EVEN IF IT'S JUST FOR THE

00:02:53.494 --> 00:02:56.029
DEFENSE PURPOSES ALONE.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.130
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE SPOKE TO A

00:02:57.131 --> 00:02:57.964
GOVERNMENT EMPLOYEE WHO HAS

00:02:57.965 --> 00:03:00.166
WORKED ON THIS ISSUE WHO SAID

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:01.635
THAT THE U.S. GOVERNMENT HAS

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:03.236
WRECKAGE FROM ONE OF THESE

00:03:03.237 --> 00:03:03.603
AIRCRAFT.

00:03:03.604 --> 00:03:04.871
DO YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT

00:03:04.872 --> 00:03:05.238
THAT?

00:03:05.239 --> 00:03:06.172
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW BUT THAT IS

00:03:06.173 --> 00:03:08.041
ONE OF THE FOUR QUESTIONS THAT

00:03:08.042 --> 00:03:08.842
WE ARE ASKING.

00:03:08.843 --> 00:03:09.910
IS THERE EVIDENCE BEING HELD

00:03:09.911 --> 00:03:10.277
SOMEWHERE?

00:03:10.278 --> 00:03:11.912
NOT TO GET TOO SPOOKY ONCE

00:03:11.913 --> 00:03:12.212
AGAIN.

00:03:12.213 --> 00:03:13.780
IF THERE IS EVIDENCE, I

00:03:13.781 --> 00:03:14.714
BELIEVE IT IS IMPORTANT FOR

00:03:14.715 --> 00:03:16.082
PEOPLE SPECIFICALLY IN MY

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:17.250
POSITION AS THE RANKING MEMBER

00:03:17.251 --> 00:03:18.852
OF TERRORISM AND

00:03:18.853 --> 00:03:19.552
COUNTERINTELLIGENCE, WE NEED

00:03:19.553 --> 00:03:21.922
TO KNOW WHAT THIS IS.

00:03:21.923 --> 00:03:23.623
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE.

00:03:23.624 --> 00:03:24.991
THOSE ARE ALL LEGITIMATE

00:03:24.992 --> 00:03:25.425
QUESTIONS.

00:03:25.426 --> 00:03:26.126
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE SO.

00:03:26.127 --> 00:03:29.130
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I GRATEFUL YOU

